### Manual smoke test (VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request")
### Start the server first: Terminal > Run Task > "Relay: start reference server"
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Create workflow a -> b
POST {{base}}/workflows
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"demo","tasks":[{"name":"a"},{"name":"b","dependsOn":["a"]}],"retry":{"maxAttempts":2,"baseBackoffMs":1000}}

### Start a run (send twice: second time returns 200 with the same run)
POST {{base}}/workflows/wf_1/runs
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: k1

{"input":{"day":1}}

### Worker leases the next ready task
POST {{base}}/leases
Content-Type: application/json

{"workerId":"w1"}

### Complete it
POST {{base}}/leases/lease_1/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{"output":"done"}

### Fail it instead (try on lease_2)
POST {{base}}/leases/lease_2/fail
Content-Type: application/json

{"error":"boom"}

### Advance the logical clock
POST {{base}}/_test/clock/advance
Content-Type: application/json

{"ms":1000}

### Inspect the run
GET {{base}}/runs/run_1

### Event log
GET {{base}}/runs/run_1/events

### Cancel the run
POST {{base}}/runs/run_1/cancel
